      "text": "**Foreign ownership transformation**: Before 2003, top English clubs were owned by local businessmen. Roman Abramovich's purchase of Chelsea 2003 (£140M) triggered an era of foreign oligarch and state-backed ownership:\n- Chelsea: Abramovich (Russia, 2003-2022) -> Todd Boehly/Clearlake (USA, 2022)\n- Manchester City: Thaksin Shinawatra (Thailand, 2007) -> Sheikh Mansour/Abu Dhabi (2008)\n- Arsenal: Stan Kroenke (USA, 2011, full ownership 2018)\n- Liverpool: Fenway Sports Group (USA, 2010)\n- Manchester United: Glazer family (USA, 2005) -> INEOS (part, 2024)"
